  "Some games ship more than one renderer -- Where Winds Meet links DX11 in its exe and carries a DX12 path beside it -- and detection can only name one. The upscaler key, the DLSS5 Feeder, OptiScaler's own Frame Generation and DLSS NR on AMD all follow this, so pick what the game's own video settings actually use. Applied to OptiScaler.ini straight away if it is installed.": "有些游戏带有不止一个渲染器 -- Where Winds Meet 的 exe 链接了 DX11，旁边还带有 DX12 路径 -- 而检测只能指出其中一个。超采样器键、DLSS5 Feeder、OptiScaler 自带的帧生成以及 AMD 上的 DLSS NR 都跟随此选择，所以请选择游戏视频设置中实际使用的那个。如果已安装 OptiScaler，会立即应用到 OptiScaler.ini。",
