  "DLSS 5 Neural Rendering on AMD": "AMD 上的 DLSS 5 神经渲染",
  "This machine has an AMD card. OptiScaler's own Neural Rendering needs NVIDIA's NGX runtime, so it installs here but never renders anything new. <a href=\"https://github.com/danielblnc/DLSS-NR-on-AMD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DLSS-NR-on-AMD</a> (danielblnc, alpha) is the route instead: a from-scratch NR runtime for RX 7000/9000 that hooks the game's own FSR 3/4. Needs Windows 11, Adrenalin 26.1.1 or newer, a DX12 game with FSR turned on in its settings, and no anti-cheat. Its licence forbids bundling or redistributing it, so this app does not download it: <strong>get <code>dlssnr_on_amd_setup.exe</code> from the release page, put it beside the game exe, and run it</strong>. This app fetches the model file it asks for (plain 310.8.0, not the modified build the NVIDIA path uses), tells you when a new release is out, and runs the installer for you once it is in the folder. For a DLSS-only game with no FSR, OptiScaler can supply FSR -- untested together with this tool.": "这台电脑使用的是 AMD 显卡。OptiScaler 自带的神经渲染需要 NVIDIA 的 NGX 运行时，所以它在这里能安装，但不会渲染出任何新内容。取而代之的路线是 <a href=\"https://github.com/danielblnc/DLSS-NR-on-AMD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DLSS-NR-on-AMD</a>（danielblnc，alpha 版）：为 RX 7000/9000 从零实现的 NR 运行时，挂钩游戏自己的 FSR 3/4。需要 Windows 11、Adrenalin 26.1.1 或更新版本、在设置中开启了 FSR 的 DX12 游戏，且没有反作弊。它的许可证禁止捆绑或再分发，所以本应用不会下载它：<strong>请从发布页面获取 <code>dlssnr_on_amd_setup.exe</code>，放到游戏 exe 旁边并运行</strong>。本应用会获取它所需的模型文件（普通的 310.8.0，而不是 NVIDIA 路线使用的修改版），在有新版本时提醒你，并在它进入文件夹后替你运行安装程序。对于只有 DLSS 而没有 FSR 的游戏，OptiScaler 可以提供 FSR -- 但未与此工具一起测试过。",
  "Open release page": "打开发布页面",
