  "<strong>Click \"Deploy Luma UE\".</strong> This downloads and places everything Luma needs directly in the game's folder: its shader files, its own <code>dxgi.dll</code> renamed to <code>ReShade64.dll</code>, its compiled add-on, and <code>nvngx_dlss.dll</code>. OptiScaler itself must already be installed for this game first (use the Install button) -- Deploy only adds Luma on top of that.": "<strong>点击“部署 Luma UE”。</strong>这会下载并把 Luma 所需的一切直接放进游戏文件夹：它的着色器文件、重命名为 <code>ReShade64.dll</code> 的自带 <code>dxgi.dll</code>、编译好的插件，以及 <code>nvngx_dlss.dll</code>。此游戏必须先安装好 OptiScaler（使用安装按钮）-- 部署只是在其之上添加 Luma。",
