  "NVIDIA Frame Generation multiplier": "NVIDIA 帧生成倍率",
  "The game's own DLSS Frame Generation -- how many frames it makes per rendered frame. Turn Frame Generation on in the game's video settings as usual; this only changes the multiplier it asks for. 3x and 4x need an RTX 50 series -- other cards stay at 2x. Also adjustable live from the Alt+Home panel.": "游戏自带的 DLSS 帧生成 -- 每渲染一帧生成多少帧。照常在游戏的视频设置中开启帧生成；这里只改变它请求的倍率。3x 和 4x 需要 RTX 50 系列 -- 其他显卡保持 2x。也可在 Alt+Home 面板中实时调整。",
