  "Come back here -- if it still crashes, the next step is putting the game back": "回到这里 -- 如果仍然崩溃，下一步是把游戏恢复原样",
  "Two frame generators: Smooth Motion and {generator}": "两个帧生成器：Smooth Motion 和 {generator}",
  "dgVoodoo2 crashes this game -- DXVK is worth a try": "dgVoodoo2 导致此游戏崩溃 -- 值得试试 DXVK",
  "OptiScaler never loaded -- this game has its own DLSS": "从未加载 OptiScaler -- 此游戏自带 DLSS",
  "DXVK shakes this game -- go back to dgVoodoo2": "DXVK 让此游戏抖动 -- 换回 dgVoodoo2",
  "Nothing called DLSS -- dgVoodoo2 is the likely reason": "没有调用 DLSS -- 很可能是 dgVoodoo2 的原因",
  "Nothing called DLSS under DXVK either -- try dgVoodoo2 again": "在 DXVK 下也没有调用 DLSS -- 再试试 dgVoodoo2",
  "DXVK crashes this game -- dgVoodoo2 is worth another try": "DXVK 导致此游戏崩溃 -- 值得再试一次 dgVoodoo2",
  "Nothing called DLSS under DXVK -- try native Direct3D again": "在 DXVK 下没有调用 DLSS -- 再试试原生 Direct3D",
