  "ReShade loaded under DXVK, the DLSS5 Feeder did not": "ReShade 已在 DXVK 下加载，DLSS5 Feeder 没有",
  "Run the game once under DXVK, then check again": "在 DXVK 下运行一次游戏，然后再检查",
  "Working -- but exclusive fullscreen hides the panel": "正常工作 -- 但独占全屏隐藏了面板",
