  "Try DXVK instead": "改试 DXVK",
  "Try dgVoodoo2 instead": "改试 dgVoodoo2",
  "Use native Direct3D 11": "使用原生 Direct3D 11",
  "Puts dgVoodoo2 back in place of DXVK, handing back whatever DXVK displaced. On a 32-bit game the game-folder ReShade returns with it; ReShade's Vulkan layer stays installed on the PC.": "用 dgVoodoo2 替换回 DXVK，并交还 DXVK 替换掉的所有内容。在 32 位游戏中，游戏文件夹中的 ReShade 也会一起回来；ReShade 的 Vulkan 层仍保留安装在电脑上。",
  "Takes DXVK back out, handing back whatever it displaced, and returns the game-folder ReShade (dxgi.dll) so the game runs on its own Direct3D again. ReShade's Vulkan layer stays installed on the PC.": "移除 DXVK，交还它替换掉的所有内容，并恢复游戏文件夹中的 ReShade（dxgi.dll），让游戏重新在自己的 Direct3D 上运行。ReShade 的 Vulkan 层仍保留安装在电脑上。",
  "Runs this game's Direct3D 10/11 on Vulkan through DXVK (d3d10core.dll, d3d11.dll, dxgi.dll beside the exe) instead of natively. The game-folder ReShade is set aside and ReShade's 32-bit Vulkan layer set up in its place, which asks for administrator permission and is installed for the whole PC. Anything DXVK displaces is backed up, so it can be undone.": "通过 DXVK 让此游戏的 Direct3D 10/11 在 Vulkan 上运行（exe 旁放置 d3d10core.dll、d3d11.dll、dxgi.dll），而不是原生运行。游戏文件夹中的 ReShade 会被移到一边，改为设置 ReShade 的 32 位 Vulkan 层，这需要管理员权限并为整台电脑安装。DXVK 替换的所有内容都会备份，因此可以撤销。",
  "Setting up DXVK first…": "正在先设置 DXVK…",
  "DXVK could not be set up: {error}": "无法设置 DXVK：{error}",
  "Installed on the game's own Direct3D: DXVK could not be put in front of it ({error}). The choice is kept; Game Help can try again.": "已安装在游戏自己的 Direct3D 上：无法把 DXVK 放到前面（{error}）。选择会被保留；游戏帮助可以再试一次。",
  "Installed, but ReShade's 32-bit Vulkan layer is not set up ({error}), so DLSS 5 cannot run under DXVK yet. Game Help can try again.": "已安装，但 ReShade 的 32 位 Vulkan 层未设置（{error}），所以 DLSS 5 暂时无法在 DXVK 下运行。游戏帮助可以再试一次。",
  "{count} passes": "{count} 次处理",
  "{fps} fps": "{fps} fps",
  "Back to default. Applies the next time the game starts.": "已恢复默认。下次启动游戏时生效。",
